<title>FRANCE: Club Med suspended pending statement.</title>
<headline>Club Med suspended pending statement.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trading in French leisure group Club Mediterranee was suspended before the opening of the Paris bourse on Friday pending a statement from the company later in the day.</p>
<p>The SBF and the company confirmed the suspension.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company said the statement should be forthcoming later in the day.</p>
<p>The Club Med board is meeting on Friday but the spokesman would give no further information.</p>
<p>La Tribune newspaper said on Friday the company was expected to end the 1996 financial year in the red.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
